explain (costs off)
select x from (values (row(1, 2)), (row(1, 3))) _(x) union select x from (values (row(1, 2)), (row(1, 4))) _(x);
                  QUERY PLAN                   
-----------------------------------------------
 Unique
   ->  Sort
         Sort Key: "*VALUES*".column1
         ->  Append
               ->  Values Scan on "*VALUES*"
               ->  Values Scan on "*VALUES*_1"
